linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

Justice has nothing to do with me.
I sing the way I want to;
I kill the way I want to.

And anyhow, you can't shine on your own.
After all, you shine like the moon;
you don't shine from yourself, like the sun.

She's a girl who never yielded to temptation;
she kept being herself. If the words come from
you, she may come around.
